<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Engro rises 2.86 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Engro rises 2.86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engro Chemical Pakistan Ltd rose 4.00 rupees, or 2.86 percent, to 144 on Sunday on fresh buying by foreign fund managers before its September 16-30 book closure for entitlement to a 30 percent cash interim dividend for the first half ended in June, dealers said.</p>
<p>Some 8,600 Engro shares changed hands in early trade at the Karachi Stock Exchange, one dealer said.</p>
<p>The firm paid a 60 percent cash dividend and 20 percent bonus stocks for its financial year ended in December.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
